From 7984f064554e6ff820b26efa9918dcd9052e522d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sitering-ai <dev@sitering.ai>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 15:34:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Fish Audio TTS, Twilio UK compliance, automatic number
 provisioning

Replaces Cartesia with Fish Audio (TTS) and OpenAI gpt-4o-transcribe (STT),
and fills the gap where onboarding collected ID documents but never sent
them anywhere:

- Twilio regulatory bundles, branching sole trader vs limited company
- migration 06: business_type, bundle SIDs, Twilio's own status spellings
- automatic submission on signup, hourly poll, number purchase on approval
- numbers are attached to the SIP trunk, or not bought at all
- 'your number is live' email; build guards now ban Cartesia/ElevenLabs
- 10 tests on the rejection parser

Verified: 10/10 tests, tsc clean, next build 23 routes, migration tested
against Postgres 17.
